}{z}\\right)$  on the circle":[58,80],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##5. Compute $$\\int_{z=|r|}xdz$$ for the positive sense in two ways, first by the use of parameters and second, by observing that $x = \\frac{z+\\overline z}{2}=\\frac{1}{2}\\left(z+ r^{2}{z}\\right)$  on the circle#{1}":[59,80],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##6. Compute $$\\int_{|z|=2} \\frac{dz}{z^{2}-1}$$ in the positive sense of the circle":[81,92],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##6. Compute $$\\int_{|z|=2} \\frac{dz}{z^{2}-1}$$ in the positive sense of the circle#{1}":[83,92],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##7.":[93,115],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##7.##a)":[94,100],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##7.##a)#{1}":[95,100],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##7.##b)":[101,103],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##7.##b)#{1}":[102,103],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##7.##c)":[104,109],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##7.##c)#{1}":[105,109],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##7.##d)":[110,115],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##7.##d)#{1}":[111,115],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##8. Compute $$\\int_{|z|=1} \\frac{e^{z}}{z}dz$$":[116,124],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##8. Compute $$\\int_{|z|=1} \\frac{e^{z}}{z}dz$$#{1}":[117,124],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##9. Compute $$\\int_{|z|=2} \\frac{dz}{z^{2}+1}$$ by decomposing the integrand in partial fraction":[125,137],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##9. Compute $$\\int_{|z|=2} \\frac{dz}{z^{2}+1}$$ by decomposing the integrand in partial fraction#{1}":[126,137],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##10 Compute $$\\int_{|z|=\\rho} \\frac{|dz|}{|z-a|^{2}}$$ under the condition that $|a| \\ne \\rho$":[138,153],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##10 Compute $$\\int_{|z|=\\rho} \\frac{|dz|}{|z-a|^{2}}$$ under the condition that $|a| \\ne \\rho$#{1}":[139,153],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##11. Compute $$\\begin{align*}\\int_{|z|=1} e^{z}z^{-n}dz,\\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\int_{|z|=2}z^{n}(1-z)^{m}dz,\\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\int_{|z|=\\rho} |z-a|^{-4}|dz|\\ (|a|\\ne\\rho)\\end{align*}$$":[154,188],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##11. Compute $$\\begin{align*}\\int_{|z|=1} e^{z}z^{-n}dz,\\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\int_{|z|=2}z^{n}(1-z)^{m}dz,\\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\ \\int_{|z|=\\rho} |z-a|^{-4}|dz|\\ (|a|\\ne\\rho)\\end{align*}$$#{1}":[155,188],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##12. Prove that a function which is analytic in the whole plane and satisfies the inequality $|f(z)|<|z|$ for some $n$ and all sufficiently large $|z|$ reduces to a polynomial":[189,201],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##12. Prove that a function which is analytic in the whole plane and satisfies the inequality $|f(z)|<|z|$ for some $n$ and all sufficiently large $|z|$ reduces to a polynomial#{1}":[190,201],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##13. If $f(z)$ is analytic and $|f(z)|\\le M$ for $|z|\\le R$, find and upper bound for $f^{(n)}(z)$ in $|z|\\le\\rho< R$":[202,213],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##13. If $f(z)$ is analytic and $|f(z)|\\le M$ for $|z|\\le R$, find and upper bound for $f^{(n)}(z)$ in $|z|\\le\\rho< R$#{1}":[203,213],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##14. If $f(z)$ is analytic for $|z|<1$ and $|f(z)|\\le \\frac{1}{1-|z|}$, find the best estimate of $|f^{(n)}(0)|$ that Cauchy Inequality will yield.":[214,226],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##14. If $f(z)$ is analytic for $|z|<1$ and $|f(z)|\\le \\frac{1}{1-|z|}$, find the best estimate of $|f^{(n)}(0)|$ that Cauchy Inequality will yield.#{1}":[215,226],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##15. Show that successive derivatives of an analytic function at a point can never satisfy $|f^{(n)}(z)|>n!n^{n}$. Fromulate a sharper theorem of the same kind":[227,236],"#Complex Analysis Assignment 3##15. Show that successive derivatives of an analytic function at a point can never satisfy $|f^{(n)}(z)|>n!n^{n}$. Fromulate a sharper theorem of the same kind#{1}":[228,236]},"mtime":1703166363218,"size":11190,"hash":"7042888742db017c0fa3f49f0590d0e6a1d91926b871e8f2e4ebc8317ded8eb0","last_read_hash":"7042888742db017c0fa3f49f0590d0e6a1d91926b871e8f2e4ebc8317ded8eb0","outlinks":[]}
